# email_move — Move Email

Move an email to another mailbox/folder.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** Email UID to move */
  uid: number;
  /** Destination mailbox name */
  destination: string;
  /** Profile name to use. Uses active profile if omitted. */
  profile?: string;
  /** Source mailbox, defaults to INBOX */
  source?: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://email_move.
